Initially, I would have suggested to try for a wand of death, 
but you could also wish for a figurine of a brown/black pudding 
if you're into the farming business: Start with farming on the 
level above mine town; if you're buffed up enough, you can go 
and finish the priest (with dagger throws preferrably, or 
wands of hurt you got from farming), drag some puddings down 
to mine town and start the serious farming.  Would be tiresome, 
but almost guaranteed success.  (To avoid soldier ant related 
problems, you could also start farming on level 1, but then 
the farming in mine town might be complicated to get going.)  

If you don't get a wish, I'd hang around hoping to meet a random 
pudding until I'm running low on food.  

